-------Android-----
1.Install pydroid 3 from the Google Play Store or install the APK
2.in the pydroid terminal and enter the command (pip install pygame)
3.Go to this page, download (Zbieranie Jabłek symulator.py) and unzip it in pydroid 3. 
4.Click the folder icon to open it. Allow permissions and select this project (Zbieranie jabłek symulator.py)
5.and click the yellow icon. 
6.The project with the keyboard should open. Click Back to hide it.
7.done
Yes, I know there's a small screen in version 1.0. I'll fix that in version 1.1.


-------Windows/linux/macOS-------
1.install Visual Studio Code
2.click extensions
3.search for phyton and install
4.click on the file and open the file, select the location of this project (Zbieranie Jabłek symulator.py)
5.after selecting the project, click on Open,
6.in terminal type "pip install pygame"
7.After installing pygame, click open and the game window will open
8.Done!

